## Factory
This repo is served by the software factory (`factory.yml`).
- `factory.yml` `test` is the red/green gate: it must fail on the red commit
  and pass on the final one.
- `ticket_modes` in `factory.yml` say what the red tests must assert for each kind
  of ticket (for example `default` for code, `content` for posts).
- The verifier uses `docs/app-navigation.md`. Update it when you add or move
  a route or persistent UI.
- Never edit `factory.yml` or any `protected_paths` entry.
